{"id":"u-7954ab7b-a005-433d-b493-1f6a4dccff83","src":"community","title":"Bench_Chest_Boostcamp_Full","author":"John R.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/WlARep-benchchestboostcampfull","desc":"BENCH + CHEST SPECIALISATION PROGRAM\nGoal: Increase bench press strength while aggressively bringing up chest size (especially upper chest) without sacrificing back, legs, delts or trap development.\n\nPrimary Goal:\nBench Press: 110 kg → 120+ kg\nSecondary Goal: Add chest mass and improve chest proportion vs shoulders/arms.\n\nProgram Structure:\n\nChest: 3x / week\nBack: 2x / week\nLegs: 1 dedicated day (machine bias)\nDelts/Traps: Frequent volume throughout week\nDuration: 12–16 weeks\n\nBench Progression:\nHeavy Day (Day 1):\nW1: 90 kg × 5×3\nW2: 92.5 kg\nW3: 95 kg\nW4: 97.5 kg\nW5: Deload (~80%)\nRestart +2.5 kg.\n\nVolume Day (Day 4):\n5×5 progression:\n82.5 → 85 → 87.5 → 90 kg\n\nIf all reps completed with good bar speed, increase next week.\n\nTraining Notes:\n\nCompetition bench = power focus. Drive feet into floor and maintain upper back tightness.\nPaused bench builds starting strength and power off chest.\nIncline work is prioritised to bring up upper chest fullness.\nChest day 6 = pump / metabolic work only. Chase stretch and contraction.\nUse controlled eccentric (2–3 sec lowering) on chest isolation work.\nAim to add load OR reps weekly.\nLeave approximately 1–2 reps in reserve on most work sets.\nPush final isolation set near failure.\n\nEstimated Weekly Volume:\nChest: ~25–30 sets\nBack: ~20 sets\nDelts/Traps: ~18 sets\nLegs: ~20 sets\n\nRecovery Targets:\nProtein: 180–200 g/day\nCalories: ~2500–2700 kcal (adjust to goal)\nSleep: 7–8 hrs\nSteps: Maintain military PT + daily movement.\n\nExpected Outcome (12–16 weeks):\n+7.5–10 kg bench increase\nImproved upper chest thickness\nFuller chest appearance\nMaintained overall physique balance\n\nCurrent Restrictions:\nLower back / left glute irritation present → leg work biased toward machine options to reduce spinal loading.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-19T18:44:30.011Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Bench Strength + Chest Heavy","Back Width + Delts","Legs","Bench Volume","Back Thickness + Arms","Chest Pump","Bench Strength + Chest Heavy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}],"note":"Add 2.5kg weekly · Weights: 90 kg"},{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":4,"x":4}],"note":"2 sec pause · Weights: 82.5 kg"},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}],"note":"Upper chest · Weights: 70 kg"},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":4}],"note":"Stretch focus · Weights: 55 kg"},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}],"note":"Controlled · Weights: 15/side kg"},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}],"note":"Weights: 40 kg"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Plank (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: +10 kg"},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 80 kg"},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"Weights: 75 kg"},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 50 kg"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":5}],"note":"Weights: 12.5s kg"},{"n":"Shrug (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 40s kg"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Pendulum Squat","sets":[{"r":8,"x":5}],"note":"Weights: 140 kg"},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 260 kg"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}],"note":"Weights: 22.5s kg"},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 55 kg"},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"x":4}],"note":"Weights: 55 kg"},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"x":5}],"note":"Weights: 80 kg"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":5}],"note":"Progress weekly · Weig